        "heading": "What markets and industries does Bell Boeing Joint Project Office serve?",
        "body": "Other Aircraft Parts and Auxiliary Equipment Manufacturing is the largest market at $822M. Aircraft Manufacturing is the next largest market at $499M, followed by Computer Systems Design Services at $37.6M and smaller manufacturing and services categories."
